    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "求系统的传递函数并不需要计算式 (3.18) 中的积分。相反，可以设解具有式 (3.17) 的形式，代入系统的微分方程中，进而求出传递函数 H(s)。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The integral in Eq. (3.18) does not need to be computed to find the transfer function of a system. Instead, one can assume a solution of the form of Eq. (3.17), substitute that into the differential equation of the system, then solve for the transfer function H(s).",
